{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09030","headline":"四禅精舍登览悲旧寄朝宗巨川兄弟 · 韦应物","name":"四禅精舍登览悲旧寄朝宗巨川兄弟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"萧散人事忧，迢遰古原行。\n春风日已暄，百草亦复生。\n跻阁谒金像，攀云造禅扃。\n新景林际曙，杂花川上明。\n徂岁方缅邈，陈事尚纵横。\n温泉有佳气，驰道指京城。\n携手思故日，山河留恨情。\n存者邈难见，去者已冥冥。\n临风一长恸，谁畏行路惊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09030.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09030","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}